{"bookId":"titus","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Paul, a servant of God, and an apostle of Jesus Christ, according to the faith of God’s elect, and the acknowledging of the truth which is after godliness;","tokens":[{"text":"Paul","strongs":["G3972"]},{"text":", a"},{"text":"servant","strongs":["G1401"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"an"},{"text":"apostle","strongs":["G0652"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jesus","strongs":["G2424"]},{"text":"Christ","strongs":["G5547"]},{"text":", according"},{"text":"to","strongs":["G2596"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"faith","strongs":["G4102"]},{"text":"of","strongs":["G1588"]},{"text":"God’s","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":"elect","strongs":["G1588"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"acknowledging","strongs":["G1922"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"which","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"after","strongs":["G2596"]},{"text":"godliness","strongs":["G2150"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":2,"text":"In hope of eternal life, which God, that cannot lie, promised before the world began;","tokens":[{"text":"In","strongs":["G1909"]},{"text":"hope","strongs":["G1680"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"eternal","strongs":["G0166"]},{"text":"life","strongs":["G2222"]},{"text":","},{"text":"which","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":", that cannot"},{"text":"lie","strongs":["G0893"]},{"text":","},{"text":"promised","strongs":["G1861"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["G4253"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"world","strongs":["G5550"]},{"text":"began","strongs":["G0166"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":3,"text":"But hath in due times manifested his word through preaching, which is committed unto me according to the commandment of God our Saviour;","tokens":[{"text":"But","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"hath","strongs":["G5319"]},{"text