ppeared","strongs":["G2014"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"men","strongs":["G0444"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":12,"text":"Teaching us that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we should live soberly, righteously, and godly, in this present world;","tokens":[{"text":"Teaching","strongs":["G3811"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":","},{"text":"denying","strongs":["G0720"]},{"text":"ungodliness","strongs":["G0763"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"worldly","strongs":["G2886"]},{"text":"lusts","strongs":["G1939"]},{"text":", we should"},{"text":"live","strongs":["G2198"]},{"text":"soberly","strongs":["G4996"]},{"text":","},{"text":"righteously","strongs":["G1346"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"godly","strongs":["G2153"]},{"text":","},{"text":"in","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"this","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"present","strongs":["G3568"]},{"text":"world","strongs":["G0165"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":13,"text":"Looking for that blessed hope, and the glorious appearing of the great God and our Saviour Jesus Christ;","tokens":[{"text":"Looking"},{"text":"for","strongs":["G4327"]},{"text":"that","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"blessed","strongs":["G3107"]},{"text":"hope","strongs":["G1680"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"glorious","strongs":["G1391"]},{"text":"appearing","strongs":["G2015"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"great","strongs":["G3173"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"our","strongs":["G2257"]},{"text":"Saviour","strongs":["G4990"]},{"text":"Jesus","strongs":["G2424"]},{"text":"Christ","strongs":["G5547"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":14,"text":"Who gave himself for us, that he might redeem us from all iniquity, and purify unto himself a peculiar people, zealous of good works.","tokens":[{"text":"Who","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"gave","strongs":["G1325"]},{"text":"himself","strongs":["G1438"]},{"text":"for","strongs":["G5228"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2257"]},{"text":","},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"he might"},{"text":"redeem","strongs":["G3084"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":"from","strongs":["G0575"]},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["G0458"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"purify","strongs":["G2511"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"himself","strongs":["G1438"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"peculiar","strongs":["G4041"]},{"text":"people","strongs":["G2992"]},{"text":","},{"text":"zealous","strongs":["G2207"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"good","strongs":["G2570"]},{"text":"works","strongs":["G2041"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"These things speak, and exhort, and rebuke with all authority. Let no man despise thee.","tokens":[{"text":"These"},{"text":"things","strongs":["G5023"]},{"text":"speak","strongs":["G2980"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"exhort","strongs":["G3870"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"rebuke","strongs":["G1651"]},{"text":"with","strongs":["G3326"]},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"authority","strongs":["G2003"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Let","strongs":["G4065"]},{"text":"no"},{"text":"man","strongs":["G3367"]},{"text":"despise","strongs":["G4065"]},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4675"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"3":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Put them in mind to be subject to principalities and powers, to obey magistrates, to be ready to every good work,","tokens":[{"text":"Put","strongs":["G5279"]},{"text":"them","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"mind","strongs":["G5279"]},{"text":"to be subject"},{"text":"to","strongs":["G5293"]},{"text":"principalities","strongs":["G0746"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"powers","strongs":["G1849"]},{"text":", to obey"},{"text":"magistrates","strongs":["G3980"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"be","strongs":["G1511"]},{"text":"ready","strongs":["G2092"]},{"text":"to","strongs":["G4314"]},{"text":"every","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"good","strongs":["G0018"]},{"text":"work","strongs":["G2041"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":2,"text":"To speak evil of no man, to be no brawlers, but gentle, shewing all meekness unto all men.","tokens":[{"text":"To speak evil"},{"text":"of","strongs":["G0987"]},{"text":"no"},{"text":"man","strongs":["G3367"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"be","strongs":["G1511"]},{"text":"no"},{"text":"brawlers","strongs":["G0269"]},{"text":", but"},{"text":"gentle","strongs":["G1933"]},{"text":","},{"text":"shewing","strongs":["G1731"]},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"meekness","strongs":["G4236"]},{"text":"unto","strongs":["G4314"]},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"men","strongs":["G0444"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"For we ourselves also were sometimes foolish, disobedient, deceived, serving divers lusts and pleasures, living in malice and envy, hateful, and hating one another.","tokens":[{"text":"For","strongs":["G1063"]},{"text":"we"},{"text":"ourselves","strongs":["G2249"]},{"text":"also","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"were","strongs":["G1510"]},{"text":"sometimes","strongs":["G4218"]},{"text":"foolish","strongs":["G0453"]},{"text":","},{"text":"disobedient","strongs":["G0545"]},{"text":","},{"text":"deceived","strongs":["G4105"]},{"text":","},{"text":"serving","strongs":["G1398"]},{"text":"divers","strongs":["G4164"]},{"text":"lusts","strongs":["G1939"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"pleasures","strongs":["G2237"]},{"text":","},{"text":"living","strongs":["G1236"]},{"text":"in","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"malice","strongs":["G2549"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"envy","strongs":["G5355"]},{"text":","},{"text":"hateful","strongs":["G4767"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"hating","strongs":["G3404"]},{"text":"one"},{"text":"another","strongs":["G0240"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"But after that the kindness and love of God our Saviour toward man appeared,","tokens":[{"text":"But","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"after"},{"text":"that","strongs":["G3753"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"kindness","strongs":["G5544"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"love","strongs":["G5363"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":"our","strongs":["G2257"]},{"text":"Saviour","strongs":["G4990"]},{"text":"toward"},{"text":"man","strongs":["G5363"]},{"text":"appeared","strongs":["G2014"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":5,"text":"Not by works of righteousness which we have done, but according to his mercy he saved us, by the washing of regeneration, and renewing of the Holy Ghost;","tokens":[{"text":"Not","strongs":["G3756"]},{"text":"by","strongs":["G1537"]},{"text":"works","strongs":["G2041"]},{"text":"of","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"righteousness","strongs":["G1343"]},{"text":"which","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"we","strongs":["G2249"]},{"text":"have"},{"text":"done","strongs":["G4160"]},{"text":","},{"text":"but","strongs":["G0235"]},{"text":"according"},{"text":"to","strongs":["G2596"]},{"text":"his","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":"mercy","strongs":["G1656"]},{"text":"he"},{"text":"saved","strongs":["G4982"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":","},{"text":"by","strongs":["G1223"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"washing","strongs":["G3067"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"regeneration","strongs":["G3824"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"renewing","strongs":["G0342"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"Holy","strongs":["G0040"]},{"text":"Ghost","strongs":["G4151"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":6,"text":"Which he shed on us abundantly through Jesus Christ our Saviour;","tokens":[{"text":"Which","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"he"},{"text":"shed","strongs":["G1632"]},{"text":"on","strongs":["G1909"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":"abundantly","strongs":["G4146"]},{"text":"through","strongs":["G1223"]},{"text":"Jesus","strongs":["G2424"]},{"text":"Christ","strongs":["G5547"]},{"text":"our","strongs":["G2257"]},{"text":"Saviour","strongs":["G4990"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":7,"text":"That being justified by his grace, we should be made heirs according to the hope of eternal life.","tokens":[{"text":"That","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"being"},{"text":"justified","strongs":["G1344"]},{"text":"by"},{"text":"his","strongs":["G1565"]},{"text":"grace","strongs":["G5485"]},{"text":", we should be"},{"text":"made","strongs":["G1096"]},{"text":"heirs","strongs":["G2818"]},{"text":"according"},{"text":"to","strongs":["G2596"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"hope","strongs":["G1680"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"eternal","strongs":["G0166"]},{"text":"life","strongs":["G2222"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"This is a faithful saying, and these things I will that thou affirm constantly, that they which have believed in God might be careful to maintain good works. These things are good and profitable unto men.","tokens":[{"text":"This is a"},{"text":"faithful","strongs":["G4103"]},{"text":"saying","strongs":["G3056"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"these"},{"text":"things","strongs":["G5130"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"will","strongs":["G1014"]},{"text":"that","strongs":["G1226"]},{"text":"thou","strongs":["G4571"]},{"text":"affirm"},{"text":"constantly","strongs":["G1226"]},{"text":","},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"they which have"},{"text":"believed","strongs":["G4100"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":"might be"},{"text":"careful","strongs":["G5431"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"maintain","strongs":["G4291"]},{"text":"good","strongs":["G2570"]},{"text":"works","strongs":["G2041"]},{"text":". These"},{"text":"things","strongs":["G5023"]},{"text":"are","strongs":["G2076"]},{"text":"good","strongs":["G2570"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"profitable","strongs":["G5624"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"men","strongs":["G0444"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"But avoid foolish questions, and genealogies, and contentions, and strivings about the law; for they are unprofitable and vain.","tokens":[{"text":"But","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"avoid","strongs":["G4026"]},{"text":"foolish","strongs":["G3474"]},{"text":"questions","strongs":["G2214"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"genealogies","strongs":["G1076"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"contentions","strongs":["G2054"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"strivings","strongs":["G3163"]},{"text":"about the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["G3544"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"for","strongs":["G1063"]},{"text":"they"},{"text":"are","strongs":["G1526"]},{"text":"unprofitable","strongs":["G0512"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"vain","strongs":["G3152"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"A man that is an heretick after the first and second admonition reject;","tokens":[{"text":"A"},{"text":"man","strongs":["G0444"]},{"text":"that is an"},{"text":"heretick","strongs":["G0141"]},{"text":"after","strongs":["G3326"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"first","strongs":["G1520"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"second","strongs":["G1208"]},{"text":"admonition","strongs":["G3559"]},{"text":"reject","strongs":["G3868"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":11,"text":"Knowing that he that is such is subverted, and sinneth, being condemned of himself.","tokens":[{"text":"Knowing","strongs":["G1492"]},{"text":"that","strongs":["G3754"]},{"text":"he that is"},{"text":"such","strongs":["G5108"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"subverted","strongs":["G1612"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"sinneth","strongs":["G0264"]},{"text":","},{"text":"being","strongs":["G5607"]},{"text":"condemned of"},{"text":"himself","strongs":["G0843"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"When I shall send Artemas unto thee, or Tychicus, be diligent to come unto me to Nicopolis: for I have determined there to winter.","tokens":[{"text":"When","strongs":["G3752"]},{"text":"I shall"},{"text":"send","strongs":["G3992"]},{"text":"Artemas","strongs":["G0734"]},{"text":"unto","strongs":["G4314"]},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4571"]},{"text":","},{"text":"or","strongs":["G2228"]},{"text":"Tychicus","strongs":["G5190"]},{"text":", be"},{"text":"diligent","strongs":["G4704"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"come","strongs":["G2064"]},{"text":"unto","strongs":["G4314"]},{"text":"me","strongs":["G3165"]},{"text":"to","strongs":["G1519"]},{"text":"Nicopolis","strongs":["G3533"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"for","strongs":["G1063"]},{"text":"I have"},{"text":"determined","strongs":["G2919"]},{"text":"there","strongs":["G1563"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"winter","strongs":["G3914"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Bring Zenas the lawyer and Apollos on their journey diligently, that nothing be wanting unto them.","tokens":[{"text":"Bring","strongs":["G4311"]},{"text":"Zenas","strongs":["G2211"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"lawyer","strongs":["G3544"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"Apollos","strongs":["G0625"]},{"text":"on their"},{"text":"journey","strongs":["G4311"]},{"text":"diligently","strongs":["G4709"]},{"text":","},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"nothing","strongs":["G3367"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"wanting","strongs":["G3007"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"them","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"And let ours also learn to maintain good works for necessary uses, that they be not unfruitful.","tokens":[{"text":"And","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"let","strongs":["G3129"]},{"text":"ours","strongs":["G2251"]},{"text":"also","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"learn","strongs":["G3129"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"maintain","strongs":["G4291"]},{"text":"good","strongs":["G2570"]},{"text":"works","strongs":["G2041"]},{"text":"for","strongs":["G1519"]},{"text":"necessary","strongs":["G0316"]},{"text":"uses","strongs":["G5532"]},{"text":","},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"they"},{"text":"be","strongs":["G5600"]},{"text":"not","strongs":["G3361"]},{"text":"unfruitful","strongs":["G0175"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"All that are with me salute thee. Greet them that love us in the faith. Grace be with you all. Amen. It was written to Titus, ordained the first bishop of the church of the Cretians, from Nicopolis of Macedonia.","tokens":[{"text":"All that"},{"text":"are","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"with","strongs":["G3326"]},{"text":"me","strongs":["G1700"]},{"text":"salute","strongs":["G0782"]},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4571"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Greet","strongs":["G0782"]},{"text":"them that"},{"text":"love","strongs":["G5368"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":"in","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"faith","strongs":["G4102"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Grace","strongs":["G5485"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"with","strongs":["G3326"]},{"text":"you","strongs":["G5216"]},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Amen","strongs":["G0281"]},{"text":". It was written to Titus, ordained the first bishop of the church of the Cretians, from Nicopolis of Macedonia."}]}]}}}